    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "exchange student",
            "ref": "v-exchange-student"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", I have been in London for about a year now. Before I arrived here, I "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "had no idea",
            "ref": "v-have-no-idea"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " what it would be like to study and live in London. Now, I have a clear answer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Eating in London"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It is easy to find good food in London. There are lots of restaurants and food markets. It is possible to try food from all over the world. Traditional British food includes fish and chips, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pudding",
            "zh": "布丁"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", pies, cheese, tea and cake."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Weather in London"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Does it always rain in London? No, not really. Sometimes it rains; sometimes it is sunny and beautiful. London’s weather can change very quickly. In fact, Londoners carry both "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sunglasses",
            "ref": "v-sunglasses"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and an umbrella throughout the year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Attractions in London"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "London has many famous attractions, such as the London Eye, the Tower of London and the Science Museum. You can take a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "double-decker bus",
            "zh": "双层巴士"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It will show you around the city. The buses stop near most tourist attractions. You can get off at any point. Outside the city, there is beautiful countryside and many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "castles",
            "ref": "v-castle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", parks and gardens."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In a word, London is a beautiful city. It is a good place for visiting and learning."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
